    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Step into Challenges of the Cursed Island, where every second could be your last! In this high-stakes pirate survival game, players brave a cursed island, dodging relentless explosions and mystical traps. With cunning strategy and quick reflexes, chart your way through explosive challenges, amass treasure, and conquer progressively perilous levels.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818670/extras/01f77ee87a6530976c35a05a00620c28.avif?t=1734720211\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the chaos escalates, so too does the intensity. Push your limits and see how long you can endure the relentless onslaught. With each level unlocked, the stakes rise, offering a truly immersive and exhilarating experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818670/extras/e8d5d2bd67879bce709c720fbdc4848b.poster.avif?t=1734720211\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818670/extras/e8d5d2bd67879bce709c720fbdc4848b.webm?t=1734720211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818670/extras/db908b88f75622afc557337c298208cb.avif?t=1734720211\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not content with the existing challenges? Unleash your inner game designer with the intuitive level editor. Craft your own arenas, tailor-made to test even the most seasoned players' skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818670/extras/55527ac2de1902f420add9f3500d83e9.poster.avif?t=1734720211\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818670/extras/55527ac2de1902f420add9f3500d83e9.webm?t=1734720211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818670/extras/b18066d11da7a9d7dfa52f313bfa39d4.avif?t=1734720211\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your crew and face the Cursed Island together! The game supports up to 4 players in co-op, letting friends dive into the explosive chaos side by side. Work as a team, strategize on the fly, and see if your crew has what it takes to survive the island\u2019s relentless challenges!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Are You Ready to Brave the Curse?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surviving isn\u2019t the question\u2014it's how long you can outlast the island\u2019s wrath. <i>Challenges of the Cursed Island</i> combines strategy, skill, and nerves of steel for an unending thrill ride. Step into the chaos and prove you\u2019re worthy of the pirate's path today!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Step into Challenges of the Cursed Island, where every second could be your last! In this high-stakes pirate survival game, players brave a cursed island, dodging relentless explosions and mystical traps. With cunning strategy and quick reflexes, chart your way through explosive challenges, amass treasure, and conquer progressively perilous levels.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818670/extras/01f77ee87a6530976c35a05a00620c28.avif?t=1734720211\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the chaos escalates, so too does the intensity. Push your limits and see how long you can endure the relentless onslaught. With each level unlocked, the stakes rise, offering a truly immersive and exhilarating experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818670/extras/e8d5d2bd67879bce709c720fbdc4848b.poster.avif?t=1734720211\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818670/extras/e8d5d2bd67879bce709c720fbdc4848b.webm?t=1734720211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818670/extras/db908b88f75622afc557337c298208cb.avif?t=1734720211\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not content with the existing challenges? Unleash your inner game designer with the intuitive level editor. Craft your own arenas, tailor-made to test even the most seasoned players' skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818670/extras/55527ac2de1902f420add9f3500d83e9.poster.avif?t=1734720211\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818670/extras/55527ac2de1902f420add9f3500d83e9.webm?t=1734720211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818670/extras/b18066d11da7a9d7dfa52f313bfa39d4.avif?t=1734720211\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your crew and face the Cursed Island together! The game supports up to 4 players in co-op, letting friends dive into the explosive chaos side by side. Work as a team, strategize on the fly, and see if your crew has what it takes to survive the island\u2019s relentless challenges!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Are You Ready to Brave the Curse?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surviving isn\u2019t the question\u2014it's how long you can outlast the island\u2019s wrath. <i>Challenges of the Cursed Island</i> combines strategy, skill, and nerves of steel for an unending thrill ride. Step into the chaos and prove you\u2019re worthy of the pirate's path today!</p>",
    "short_description": "Survive the Cursed Island\u2019s explosive challenges in this high-intensity multiplayer action game. Dodge relentless blasts, face trial after trial, or craft your own chaotic levels. Can you outlast the Curse and return home?",
